            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "{\"id\":\"a0cb4914-830a-44d7-8d47-457a998a0f22\",\"content\":{\"chat_list\":[{\"label\":\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتويته\",\"question\":\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتويته\",\"answer\":[\"\"],\"reasoning\":[{\"startedAt\":null,\"endedAt\":null,\"reasoning\":\"\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0}],\"blocks\":[{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"The user is asking in Arabic: \\\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتويته\\\" which means \\\"Explain to me in my country, all its contents\\\" — actually \\\"وضحلي ببلدية كل محتويته\\\" might be \\\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتوياته\\\" = \\\"Explain to me, in my dialect/language, all its contents\\\". Hmm, \\\"ببلدي\\\" could mean \\\"in my dialect\\\" (باللهجة العامية / ببلدي = in my country's dialect) or \\\"بلدي\\\" = \\\"my country\\\". Actually in Egyptian dialect, \\\"ببلدي\\\" might be \\\"في بلدي\\\" hmm.\\n\\nWait, let me re-read: \\\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتويته\\\" — likely \\\"وضحلي بالبلدي كل محتوايته\\\" = \\\"Explain to me in plain/simple (Arabic dialect) all its contents\\\". In Egyptian Arabic, \\\"بالبلدي\\\" means \\\"in simple terms / in the local dialect\\\". So the user wants me to explain the contents of the image (the file provided) in simple Arabic.\\n\\nThe file is an image: https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/upload/notegpt/ai-chat/2026/08/25/01a03764e79073f88c66596f82518578.png — \\\"verify_5_after_swipe.png\\\". I need to download it first using curl or wget, then analyze it with image_recognition.\\n\\nLet me first download the file, then use image_recognition to see its contents, then explain in Arabic (Egyptian dialect, \\\"بالبلدي\\\").\\n\\nLet me download the image first.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:50.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:53.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":3},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:53.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_f4nJQGEnM6PZKFE4aHOB8832\",\"name\":\"execute\",\"args\":{\"command\":\"curl -sL \\\"https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/upload/notegpt/ai-chat/2026/08/25/01a03764e79073f88c66596f82518578.png\\\" -o /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png && ls -la /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png && file /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\",\"__result\":\"-rw-r--r-- 1 daytona daytona 110637 Aug 25 05:29 /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\n/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png: PNG image data, 540 x 960, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\\n\\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]\"},\"result\":\"-rw-r--r-- 1 daytona daytona 110637 Aug 25 05:29 /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\n/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png: PNG image data, 540 x 960, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\\n\\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:53.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:55.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_f4nJQGEnM6PZKFE4aHOB8832\",\"name\":\"execute\",\"content\":\"-rw-r--r-- 1 daytona daytona 110637 Aug 25 05:29 /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\n/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png: PNG image data, 540 x 960, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\\n\\n[Command succeeded with exit code 0]\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:55.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:55.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"The image is downloaded. Now let me analyze it with image_recognition. But image_recognition needs a URL. Since the image is local, I can use the original URL since it's hosted. Let me use image_recognition with the original URL.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:56.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:56.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"تم تحميل الصورة بنجاح ✅ دلوقتي هحللها وأشوف كل محتواها بالتفصيل.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:56.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:57.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":1,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:58.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_BpzqgCTKvWeTGv1LMiHk6161\",\"name\":\"image_recognition\",\"args\":{\"image_url\":\"https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/upload/notegpt/ai-chat/2026/08/25/01a03764e79073f88c66596f82518578.png\",\"prompt\":\"Describe this image in full detail. Extract ALL text visible in the image (word by word, including any titles, labels, buttons, numbers, percentages, dates, names). Also describe the visual layout: what type of screen is this (app UI, website, report, chat, verification screen, etc.), colors, icons, charts, and any other content. Be exhaustive.\",\"__result\":\"This is a portrait-oriented **WhatsApp phone-number verification/setup screen** on an Android device.\\n\\n### Visible text\\n\\n- **12:37** — device status-bar time\\n- **A** — small status-bar icon inside a light square\\n- **Enter your phone number** — large page title\\n- **WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.**\\n- **Carrier charges may apply.**\\n- **What's my number?** — blue help link\\n- **Egypt** — selected country\\n- **+ 20** — country calling code\\n- **10 05566556** — phone-number field contents\\n- **Link as a companion device.**\\n- **Log in** — green link\\n- **Next** — bottom action button\\n\\n### Layout and visual appearance\\n\\n- The screen has a white background and is displayed in a tall smartphone layout.\\n- A dark charcoal Android status bar spans the top.\\n  - The time **12:37** appears at the upper left in white.\\n  - A small square icon containing **A** appears near the time.\\n  - At the upper right are white system icons for Wi‑Fi/network connectivity, cellular signal, and battery.\\n- Near the upper-right area of the white content region is a vertical three-dot overflow menu icon in very light gray.\\n- Centered near the top is the large black title **“Enter your phone number.”**\\n- Beneath it is explanatory gray text arranged over two lines:\\n  - “WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.”\\n  - “Carrier charges may apply.”\\n  The phrase **“What’s my number?”** follows on the second line in bold blue.\\n- Below the explanatory text is a country selector:\\n  - **Egypt** is centered.\\n  - A small green downward-pointing triangle appears to its right.\\n  - A thin green horizontal underline spans the selector area.\\n- The next row contains two phone-number input areas:\\n  - On the left, **“+ 20”** appears in gray/black text with a short green underline.\\n  - On the right, **“10 05566556”** appears in dark text with a longer green underline.\\n- Centered below the number fields is the companion-device option:\\n  - **“Link as a companion device.”** in dark gray/black.\\n  - **“Log in”** in bold green.\\n- At the bottom is a wide, rounded green button labeled **“Next”** in white bold text. It spans most of the screen width with margins on both sides.\\n- The overall design uses WhatsApp-style green accents, black/dark gray text, blue link text, and thin green field underlines. There are no charts, images, photos, percentages, dates, or other data visualizations visible.\"},\"result\":\"This is a portrait-oriented **WhatsApp phone-number verification/setup screen** on an Android device.\\n\\n### Visible text\\n\\n- **12:37** — device status-bar time\\n- **A** — small status-bar icon inside a light square\\n- **Enter your phone number** — large page title\\n- **WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.**\\n- **Carrier charges may apply.**\\n- **What's my number?** — blue help link\\n- **Egypt** — selected country\\n- **+ 20** — country calling code\\n- **10 05566556** — phone-number field contents\\n- **Link as a companion device.**\\n- **Log in** — green link\\n- **Next** — bottom action button\\n\\n### Layout and visual appearance\\n\\n- The screen has a white background and is displayed in a tall smartphone layout.\\n- A dark charcoal Android status bar spans the top.\\n  - The time **12:37** appears at the upper left in white.\\n  - A small square icon containing **A** appears near the time.\\n  - At the upper right are white system icons for Wi‑Fi/network connectivity, cellular signal, and battery.\\n- Near the upper-right area of the white content region is a vertical three-dot overflow menu icon in very light gray.\\n- Centered near the top is the large black title **“Enter your phone number.”**\\n- Beneath it is explanatory gray text arranged over two lines:\\n  - “WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.”\\n  - “Carrier charges may apply.”\\n  The phrase **“What’s my number?”** follows on the second line in bold blue.\\n- Below the explanatory text is a country selector:\\n  - **Egypt** is centered.\\n  - A small green downward-pointing triangle appears to its right.\\n  - A thin green horizontal underline spans the selector area.\\n- The next row contains two phone-number input areas:\\n  - On the left, **“+ 20”** appears in gray/black text with a short green underline.\\n  - On the right, **“10 05566556”** appears in dark text with a longer green underline.\\n- Centered below the number fields is the companion-device option:\\n  - **“Link as a companion device.”** in dark gray/black.\\n  - **“Log in”** in bold green.\\n- At the bottom is a wide, rounded green button labeled **“Next”** in white bold text. It spans most of the screen width with margins on both sides.\\n- The overall design uses WhatsApp-style green accents, black/dark gray text, blue link text, and thin green field underlines. There are no charts, images, photos, percentages, dates, or other data visualizations visible.\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:29:58.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:05.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_BpzqgCTKvWeTGv1LMiHk6161\",\"name\":\"image_recognition\",\"content\":\"This is a portrait-oriented **WhatsApp phone-number verification/setup screen** on an Android device.\\n\\n### Visible text\\n\\n- **12:37** — device status-bar time\\n- **A** — small status-bar icon inside a light square\\n- **Enter your phone number** — large page title\\n- **WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.**\\n- **Carrier charges may apply.**\\n- **What's my number?** — blue help link\\n- **Egypt** — selected country\\n- **+ 20** — country calling code\\n- **10 05566556** — phone-number field contents\\n- **Link as a companion device.**\\n- **Log in** — green link\\n- **Next** — bottom action button\\n\\n### Layout and visual appearance\\n\\n- The screen has a white background and is displayed in a tall smartphone layout.\\n- A dark charcoal Android status bar spans the top.\\n  - The time **12:37** appears at the upper left in white.\\n  - A small square icon containing **A** appears near the time.\\n  - At the upper right are white system icons for Wi‑Fi/network connectivity, cellular signal, and battery.\\n- Near the upper-right area of the white content region is a vertical three-dot overflow menu icon in very light gray.\\n- Centered near the top is the large black title **“Enter your phone number.”**\\n- Beneath it is explanatory gray text arranged over two lines:\\n  - “WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.”\\n  - “Carrier charges may apply.”\\n  The phrase **“What’s my number?”** follows on the second line in bold blue.\\n- Below the explanatory text is a country selector:\\n  - **Egypt** is centered.\\n  - A small green downward-pointing triangle appears to its right.\\n  - A thin green horizontal underline spans the selector area.\\n- The next row contains two phone-number input areas:\\n  - On the left, **“+ 20”** appears in gray/black text with a short green underline.\\n  - On the right, **“10 05566556”** appears in dark text with a longer green underline.\\n- Centered below the number fields is the companion-device option:\\n  - **“Link as a companion device.”** in dark gray/black.\\n  - **“Log in”** in bold green.\\n- At the bottom is a wide, rounded green button labeled **“Next”** in white bold text. It spans most of the screen width with margins on both sides.\\n- The overall design uses WhatsApp-style green accents, black/dark gray text, blue link text, and thin green field underlines. There are no charts, images, photos, percentages, dates, or other data visualizations visible.\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:05.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:05.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"The image is a WhatsApp phone number verification/setup screen. The user asked \\\"وضحلي ببلدي كل محتويته\\\" — \\\"explain to me in my dialect (بالبلدي = in simple/plain Arabic, likely Egyptian dialect) all its contents.\\\"\\n\\nThe user wants a detailed explanation of everything in the image, in simple Arabic (Egyptian dialect, since \\\"بالبلدي\\\" is a colloquial term). Let me write a detailed explanation in Egyptian Arabic covering all the elements:\\n\\n1. Status bar (12:37, Wi-Fi, battery icons)\\n2. Page title \\\"Enter your phone number\\\"\\n3. Explanatory text \\\"WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number. Carrier charges may apply.\\\"\\n4. \\\"What's my number?\\\" link\\n5. Country selector: Egypt, +20\\n6. Phone number field: 10 05566556\\n7. \\\"Link as a companion device\\\" / \\\"Log in\\\"\\n8. \\\"Next\\\" button\\n\\nI'll explain it in Egyptian dialect (ببلدي) since that seems to be what they want. The phrase \\\"وضحلي ببلدي\\\" = \\\"وضحلي بالبلدي\\\" = \\\"explain to me in plain/simple language (Egyptian dialect)\\\".\\n\\nI should provide a thorough explanation in Egyptian Arabic, walking through the screen section by section. I don't need to upload the file since it's a hosted URL — actually, the rule says any filename appearing in my text response must be uploaded via upload_files first. The image is hosted at a URL. Hmm, I downloaded it locally at /home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png. I could upload it so the user can see it. But it's their own image. I think I can just reference it via the original URL or upload the local copy.\\n\\nActually, to be safe and helpful, I can upload the local file so the user has a link. But the user provided the image themselves, so it's not strictly necessary. The rule says \\\"Any filename ... appearing anywhere in your text response MUST be uploaded via upload_files first.\\\" If I mention the filename, I should upload it. I can avoid mentioning the filename, or I can upload it. Let me upload it to be safe and link it nicely — actually the user already has the image. But if I want to reference it as a link in my response, I should upload. Let me just upload the local file and link it descriptively.\\n\\nLet me write the explanation in Egyptian Arabic (\\\"بالبلدي\\\"):\\n\\nالصورة دي هي شاشة من واتساب، وهي شاشة إدخال رقم الموبايل (تسجيل رقمك عشان تفعيل الحساب). أشرح كل حاجة بالترتيب:\\n\\n1. **شريط الحالة (الستاتس بار)** فوق: الساعة 12:37، أيقونات الشبكة والواي فاي والبطارية.\\n2. **العنوان الكبير**: \\\"Enter your phone number\\\" يعني \\\"اكتب رقم موبايلك\\\".\\n3. **الجملة اللي تحته**: \\\"WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number\\\" يعني واتساب هيحتاج يتأكد من رقمك. \\\"Carrier charges may apply\\\" يعني ممكن تتحاسب من شركة المحمول لو الرسالة بتكلفة.\\n4. **\\\"What's my number?\\\"** رابط أزرق — لو مش فاكر رقمك، اضغط عليه يوريك رقمك.\\n5. **اختيار الدولة**: مصر، كود البلد +20.\\n6. **خانة الرقم**: 10 05566556 — الرقم اللي بيتكتب دلوقتي هو رقم مصري (10 05566556) — يعني 01005566556.\\n7. **\\\"Link as a companion device\\\"** + \\\"Log in\\\" — خيار إنك تربط الجهاز ده كجهاز مساعد/مرافق (زي واتساب ويب على تابلت أو جهاز تاني) وتسجل دخول بحساب موجود.\\n8. **زرار \\\"Next\\\"** الأخضر في الآخر — تضغط عليه عشان تكمل وتتحقق من الرقم.\\n\\nI should present the final answer now. The user wants a simple explanation in Egyptian dialect. Let me write it well-structured, maybe with emojis or clear sections. Keep it in Arabic (Egyptian dialect) as requested.\\n\\nI'll upload the local file first so I can reference it as a link.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:06.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:14.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":8},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:14.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"content\":{\"id\":\"call_00_tsLGR4TFiEzrC9N6YfuI4111\",\"name\":\"upload_files\",\"args\":{\"filepath_list\":[\"/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\"],\"__result\":\"{\\\"/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\\": {\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/resource/notegpt/files/2026/08/25/4f565989d2914290bb8b3a0217ffd8a6.png\\\"}}\"},\"result\":\"{\\\"/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\\": {\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/resource/notegpt/files/2026/08/25/4f565989d2914290bb8b3a0217ffd8a6.png\\\"}}\",\"hasResult\":true},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:14.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:15.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"tool_call_result\",\"content\":{\"tool_call_id\":\"call_00_tsLGR4TFiEzrC9N6YfuI4111\",\"name\":\"upload_files\",\"content\":\"{\\\"/home/daytona/verify_5_after_swipe.png\\\": {\\\"url\\\": \\\"https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/resource/notegpt/files/2026/08/25/4f565989d2914290bb8b3a0217ffd8a6.png\\\"}}\"},\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:15.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:15.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":\"Now let me write the full explanation in Egyptian Arabic.\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:16.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:16.000Z\",\"thinkingSeconds\":0},{\"type\":\"text\",\"content\":\"تمام يا فندم 👌 دي صورة شاشة من **واتساب** بالظبط — وبالتحديد شاشة **إدخال رقم الموبايل** اللي بتظهر لما بتعمل حساب جديد أو بتربط واتساب على جهاز جديد. هشرحلك كل حاجة فيها من فوق لتحت بالبلدي وبالتفصيل:\\n\\n📱 [شاشة واتساب — إدخال رقم الهاتف](https://cdn.ng-resource.com/product/resource/notegpt/files/2026/08/25/4f565989d2914290bb8b3a0217ffd8a6.png)\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1️⃣ شريط الحالة (فوق خالص)\\n- **الساعة 12:37** — دي الساعة بتاعة الموبايل.\\n- جمبها أيقونات صغيرة: شبكة (واي فاي)، إشارة الموبايل، والبطارية — يعني جهاز شغال طبيعي.\\n\\n### 2️⃣ عنوان الصفحة (النص الكبير)\\n- **\\\"Enter your phone number\\\"** — يعني بالبلدي: **\\\"اكتب رقم موبايلك\\\"**.\\n\\n### 3️⃣ النص التوضيحي اللي تحته\\n- **\\\"WhatsApp will need to verify your phone number.\\\"** — يعني: واتساب **هيحتاج يتحقق من رقمك** (هيبعتلك كود/رسالة تأكيد).\\n- **\\\"Carrier charges may apply.\\\"** — يعني: **ممكن تتحاسب على رسالة التفعيل من شركة المحمول**، يعني ممكن تدفع فلوس لو مشتركك بيدفع على الرسائل.\\n- **\\\"What's my number?\\\"** — دي **لينك أزرق** يعني \\\"رقمي إيه؟\\\" — لو نسيت رقمك أو مش فاكر، تضغط عليه وهيوضّحلك رقمك.\\n\\n### 4️⃣ خانة اختيار الدولة\\n- مكتوب **Egypt** (مصر) ومعاها سهم أخضر صغير — يعني البلد المختارة هي مصر.\\n- وتحت جمبها كود البلد: **+20** — ده كود مصر الدولي، بيتكتب أوتوماتيك.\\n\\n### 5️⃣ خانة الرقم نفسه\\n- **\\\"10 05566556\\\"** — ده الرقم اللي اتكتب في الخانة، وده رقم مصري يعني **01005566556** (رقم موبايل 11 خانة بالظبط زي الأرقام المصرية).\\n\\n### 6️⃣ خيار تسجيل الدخول كجهاز مساعد\\n- **\\\"Link as a companion device.\\\"** — يعني \\\"اربط الجهاز ده كجهاز مرافق\\\".\\n- **\\\"Log in\\\"** — لينك أخضر يعني \\\"سجّل الدخول\\\".\\n- ✨ **الفكرة ببساطة**: لو عندك حساب واتساب شغال على موبايلك الأساسي، وبتفتح واتساب على **تابلت أو كمبيوتر**، بدل ما تسجل برقم جديد تقدر تربط الجهاز ده بالحساب الأساسي.\\n\\n### 7️⃣ الزرار الأخير (تحت في الآخر)\\n- **\\\"Next\\\"** — زرار أخضر كبير يعني **\\\"التالي\\\"** — بتضغط عليه بعد ما تتأكد إن الرقم صح، عشان تكمل خطوة التفعيل (استقبال الكود).\\n\\n---\\n\\n**باختصار شديد:** الشاشة دي أول خطوة في تسجيل واتساب — بتحط رقم موبايلك (مصر +20)، وبعدين بتدوس Next، وواتساب يبعتلك كود على رقمك تتأكد بيه إن الرقم ملكك. ولو الجهاز ده مش أول جهاز، ممكن تربطه بالحساب القديم بدل ما تعمل حساب جديد.\\n\\nلو محتاج أي حاجة تانية، أو تحب أشرحلك خطوة التفعيل اللي بعد كده بالتفصيل، قولّي 👌\",\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:16.000Z\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30:26.000Z\"},{\"type\":\"credit_usage\",\"content\":2,\"startedAt\":\"2026-08-25T05:30